WEBVTT

01:25.950 --> 01:31.600
[The Ingenious One]

01:33.190 --> 01:39.580
[Episode 13: The Hero Runs into Trouble]

01:51.970 --> 01:54.490
This is not a place to stay.

01:54.640 --> 01:55.880
Don't bother

01:55.899 --> 01:57.530
going to look for more puffer fish.

01:58.410 --> 01:59.860
It's easy to catch them.

02:00.390 --> 02:01.816
It's just that no one other than you

02:01.840 --> 02:03.460
dares to cut them open.

02:03.670 --> 02:05.400
You have to prepare them yourself.

02:05.830 --> 02:08.470
We are all looking forward to your recovery.

02:08.510 --> 02:11.166
With you around, the Cao Sect won't fall apart.

02:11.190 --> 02:13.540
That physician told me that in the long run,

02:13.950 --> 02:18.070
healing yourself with the weaker poison of pufferfish

02:18.950 --> 02:21.670
will be fighting poison with poison.

02:21.770 --> 02:23.620
You will become impervious to poison.

02:24.219 --> 02:25.736
That is why over the years,

02:25.760 --> 02:27.950
I've been fighting head-on.

02:28.000 --> 02:31.120
I'd never thought about taking it slow.

02:33.700 --> 02:35.426
Everyone in the Cao Sect comes from poverty.

02:35.450 --> 02:37.516
We need someone tough, like you, to lead us.

02:37.540 --> 02:38.756
By the way,

02:38.780 --> 02:40.566
one of our men came back this morning

02:40.590 --> 02:42.790
saying that Tang Xiao has been looking for you all over the city.

02:43.050 --> 02:44.286
All these years,

02:44.310 --> 02:46.150
how much have you done for him?

02:46.370 --> 02:48.000
How much money have you earned for him?

02:48.230 --> 02:51.590
He didn't show any mercy when things happened.

02:52.530 --> 02:53.920
It's precisely because I've done a lot

02:53.940 --> 02:55.600
and I know a lot

02:55.690 --> 02:57.606
that he's the most worried

02:57.630 --> 02:59.460
about me being alive.

03:11.280 --> 03:13.040
What do you mean?

03:14.620 --> 03:17.386
Are you resorting to underhanded tactics

03:17.410 --> 03:19.740
because beating and torturing me was useless?

03:19.860 --> 03:22.456
I will never testify against the Sect Leader.

03:22.480 --> 03:25.316
Even if you threaten me with my life,

03:25.340 --> 03:26.360
I will still say robbing and killing the traveling merchants

03:26.380 --> 03:29.290
was my idea alone.

03:30.350 --> 03:31.800
Xie Guang.

03:32.080 --> 03:33.910
The raw silk has entered the city

03:34.180 --> 03:35.820
and Qi Tianfeng has been defeated.

03:36.180 --> 03:38.080
Qi Tianfeng is ruthless.

03:38.340 --> 03:40.430
Why are you all so loyal to him?

03:40.780 --> 03:42.230
Is human life

03:42.860 --> 03:45.940
worth nothing in your eyes?

03:53.510 --> 03:56.170
Shut up and kill me!

03:58.840 --> 04:01.730
You don't even care about your own life.

04:03.870 --> 04:06.236
I can't sleep at night.

04:06.260 --> 04:08.310
As soon as I close my eyes, I can...

04:09.560 --> 04:11.040
Coward!

04:18.229 --> 04:19.679
Yes.

04:20.500 --> 04:23.520
How will you find the answer here?

04:43.960 --> 04:46.716
Why haven't you been eating well

04:46.740 --> 04:48.190
and taking care of yourself these days?

04:52.110 --> 04:55.189
You never came when I invited you to.

04:55.900 --> 04:59.450
My sister must have called for you this time.

05:00.980 --> 05:02.430
Don't worry about me.

05:05.620 --> 05:07.070
I'm fine.

05:13.120 --> 05:15.230
You don't have to pretend around me.

05:23.160 --> 05:25.120
I happened to run into your maid.

05:26.310 --> 05:28.130
She said she had finished sewing your clothes

05:28.570 --> 05:30.020
and was bringing them to you.

05:35.140 --> 05:36.590
I'm sorry.

05:38.870 --> 05:40.446
I couldn't wash the blood off,

05:40.470 --> 05:42.480
and I accidentally ripped it.

05:46.230 --> 05:48.220
I have been fighting to uphold righteousness

05:48.350 --> 05:50.790
and I've traversed the martial world.

05:50.980 --> 05:52.590
But once I see blood,

05:56.240 --> 05:58.330
I became like this again.

06:06.770 --> 06:09.340
You are kind and righteous.

06:10.250 --> 06:13.200
You see people as people.

06:14.770 --> 06:16.720
This is what I know about you.

06:17.180 --> 06:19.710
If you could sleep well the moment you came back,

06:21.300 --> 06:23.680
I would feel a little scared.

06:23.900 --> 06:25.350
It's okay.

06:28.170 --> 06:29.750
This robe is damaged.

06:31.200 --> 06:33.330
How about I make you a new one?

06:35.710 --> 06:37.160
No.

06:38.990 --> 06:40.930
This is a token of our love.

06:42.430 --> 06:44.070
It has to accompany me until I grow old.

06:46.710 --> 06:51.990
Then I'll embroider over where it was ripped.

06:52.500 --> 06:54.136
As for the bloodstain,

06:54.160 --> 06:56.240
I'll dye it black.

06:56.670 --> 06:58.500
You will definitely look good

07:00.580 --> 07:02.060
when you wear it.

07:02.590 --> 07:04.310
There's a dyeing workshop at home.

07:05.060 --> 07:06.700
Let's go now.

07:07.350 --> 07:09.870
My lady, are you relieved now?

07:16.650 --> 07:18.720
Have you talked to the workshop?

07:18.790 --> 07:22.576
Although we don’t have much time to make the tributary cloth,

07:22.600 --> 07:25.010
the craftsmanship mustn’t be careless.

07:25.670 --> 07:26.506
Don't worry.

07:26.530 --> 07:29.090
You don't need to remind me of this.

07:30.270 --> 07:32.660
Are you tired of me nagging too much?

07:32.980 --> 07:34.430
I dare not.

07:34.970 --> 07:38.436
I just meant you've been tiring yourself out over these things.

07:38.460 --> 07:40.210
Don't worry about them anymore.

07:41.270 --> 07:42.806
But there's another thing

07:42.830 --> 07:44.226
I need you to do.

07:44.250 --> 07:45.870
It won't be easy.

07:49.380 --> 07:52.300
Can you go to the Music Office

07:52.330 --> 07:55.640
and see if you can help get Ms. Ke's name off their register?

07:57.320 --> 08:00.350
Are you serious about this?

08:00.470 --> 08:02.110
What's wrong?

08:02.150 --> 08:04.526
Ms. Ke is smart.

08:04.550 --> 08:06.226
Although she's of lowly status,

08:06.250 --> 08:08.886
she's a gracious person.

08:08.910 --> 08:10.380
What's wrong with that?

08:11.300 --> 08:12.446
Nothing.

08:12.470 --> 08:13.990
It's a great thing.

08:14.630 --> 08:19.200
I'm just a little surprised.

08:20.900 --> 08:22.350
At me?

08:24.330 --> 08:26.690
Yes.

08:27.590 --> 08:28.926
It's your fault.

08:28.950 --> 08:30.400
My fault?

08:31.190 --> 08:34.750
It's your fault for being too beautiful.

08:35.689 --> 08:38.980
Why do I feel I've heard that before?

09:03.520 --> 09:04.666
Menglan.

09:04.690 --> 09:05.846
Su Mingyu.

09:05.870 --> 09:07.716
Were you lying

09:07.740 --> 09:09.550
about my Master?

09:15.920 --> 09:17.246
Let her go first.

09:17.270 --> 09:18.790
Answer me!

09:25.590 --> 09:26.966
The Cao Sect has a new leader now.

09:26.990 --> 09:29.150
Qi Tianfeng has been defeated.

09:29.420 --> 09:31.336
It's over.

09:31.360 --> 09:33.300
I advise you to think this through.

09:34.590 --> 09:36.360
Don't seek your own doom.

09:36.710 --> 09:38.160
The Cao Sect

09:39.900 --> 09:42.890
is really gone?

09:43.110 --> 09:44.560
The Cao Sect has been defeated.

09:45.440 --> 09:47.006
It was completely and utterly defeated

09:47.030 --> 09:48.950
by the Su family.

09:49.430 --> 09:51.710
If you want revenge, come for me.

09:51.750 --> 09:53.700
Taking a defenseless woman hostage

09:54.470 --> 09:57.100
isn't the Cao Sect's style.

09:57.430 --> 09:58.916
Don’t play tricks with me!

09:58.940 --> 10:00.980
I'll kill her!

10:05.590 --> 10:07.040
Fine.

10:08.310 --> 10:09.760
Let's play fair.

10:12.770 --> 10:13.886
What are you waiting for?

10:13.910 --> 10:15.640
How about I concede three more moves to you?

10:26.990 --> 10:28.750
Watch who it is you're touching.

10:28.950 --> 10:30.036
You're seeking your own doom.

10:30.060 --> 10:32.570
Do you remember your muttering?

10:32.870 --> 10:34.630
Let me teach you

10:35.230 --> 10:37.750
how to get over this.

10:43.340 --> 10:45.520
Cut off my head

10:45.710 --> 10:48.150
and let my blood splatter on your face.

10:48.590 --> 10:50.266
It's piping hot.

10:50.290 --> 10:52.160
You'll be fine after getting wet.

10:59.770 --> 11:01.410
I've killed people before.

11:02.190 --> 11:03.640
Mingyu!

11:05.990 --> 11:08.286
Don't listen to him. Put the knife down.

11:08.310 --> 11:09.996
Kill me!

11:10.020 --> 11:11.806
You'll recover if you kill me.

11:11.830 --> 11:12.846
Do it!

11:12.870 --> 11:14.950
Mingyu, don't listen to him. Put down the knife.

11:22.070 --> 11:23.806
Come on.

11:23.830 --> 11:25.940
If you had hurt her just now...

11:37.410 --> 11:38.860
Leave.

11:40.070 --> 11:41.520
I'm not the one

11:42.560 --> 11:44.010
who should be repaying your debt.

11:45.050 --> 11:46.500
Coward.

11:47.610 --> 11:49.900
You're just a coward.

11:54.420 --> 11:55.870
It's okay.

12:05.160 --> 12:06.950
This is my choice.

12:26.980 --> 12:28.430
Menglan.

12:29.350 --> 12:30.800
Thank you.

12:38.700 --> 12:42.880
[Zhang’s Pharmacy]

12:50.710 --> 12:52.160
Young Master,

12:52.590 --> 12:55.206
this medicine is supposed to act as an aide.

12:55.230 --> 13:00.230
You must avoid spicy and oily foods.

13:00.830 --> 13:04.100
Don't break the rules before you recover.

13:11.870 --> 13:13.320
You broke the rule?

13:22.310 --> 13:23.870
Willingly so.

13:30.990 --> 13:32.086
Young Master,

13:32.110 --> 13:35.030
the medicine for stabilizing and supplementing the essence is here.

13:35.410 --> 13:36.860
Take care.

13:37.050 --> 13:38.876
Count carefully.

13:38.900 --> 13:41.140
Don't panic, got it?

13:42.020 --> 13:43.286
Hurry up.

13:43.310 --> 13:44.486
You're always so slow.

13:44.510 --> 13:46.166
We're already closing, and you're still so slow.

13:46.190 --> 13:47.256
Aren't you in a hurry to go home?

13:47.280 --> 13:48.800
Close the door.

13:49.070 --> 13:49.710
Look at you.

13:49.710 --> 13:51.796
I have something important to do today.

13:51.820 --> 13:53.626
- Wait.
- Can you work carefully?

13:53.650 --> 13:55.310
Hurry up.

13:56.440 --> 13:59.710
You look so energetic, Mr. Mo. You look good.

14:00.140 --> 14:00.986
Why are you here?

14:01.010 --> 14:02.890
I was going to go look for you.

14:03.410 --> 14:05.636
I brought some herbs that are rare on the market.

14:05.660 --> 14:07.606
They can stabilize and supplement your essence, and are good for relaxing your muscles.

14:07.630 --> 14:08.990
Tell Kang Qiao to avoid oily and spicy foods

14:08.990 --> 14:10.900
while taking them.

14:13.680 --> 14:15.500
Do you want something from me?

14:18.780 --> 14:19.896
Mr. Mo,

14:19.920 --> 14:21.280
you said you had something important to tell me.

14:21.300 --> 14:22.276
What is it?

14:22.300 --> 14:23.540
Didn't Master tell us

14:23.560 --> 14:25.486
to report to him once things are settled?

14:25.510 --> 14:27.676
You disobeyed the order and let the Su family go.

14:27.700 --> 14:28.990
Let’s go and explain as soon as possible.

14:28.990 --> 14:30.536
You can still pretend to be sincere and frightened.

14:30.560 --> 14:31.726
If you drag it out,

14:31.750 --> 14:33.510
it will be hard for you to put on an act.

14:33.630 --> 14:35.150
Not tonight.

14:35.590 --> 14:36.896
Qi Tianfeng hasn't been apprehended yet.

14:36.920 --> 14:38.510
This matter is not over yet.

14:39.730 --> 14:40.776
Didn't I tell you

14:40.800 --> 14:42.650
where he's hiding?

14:43.230 --> 14:44.870
I'm short-handed.

14:45.350 --> 14:46.946
Don't come to me for this.

14:46.970 --> 14:48.456
Kang Qiao hasn't fully recovered.

14:48.480 --> 14:49.886
We lost quite a few shadowmen too.

14:49.910 --> 14:51.430
I don't have anyone for you.

14:51.590 --> 14:52.726
You said

14:52.750 --> 14:54.326
we can work together in the future.

14:54.350 --> 14:55.496
You changed your mind?

14:55.520 --> 14:57.470
Mr. Mo, you're not that kind of person, right?

14:59.200 --> 15:00.516
Besides,

15:00.540 --> 15:01.566
I only want to borrow your shadowmen

15:01.590 --> 15:03.446
to appear more intimidating.

15:03.470 --> 15:05.406
To subdue those stragglers,

15:05.430 --> 15:07.990
we'll still need your eloquence.

15:10.440 --> 15:11.846
I have to go too?

15:11.870 --> 15:13.086
Of course.

15:13.110 --> 15:15.206
Qi Tianfeng killed Mr. Wen.

15:15.230 --> 15:16.806
He is the Yuntai Sect's enemy.

15:16.830 --> 15:18.066
Subduing him

15:18.090 --> 15:19.276
will be a greatly meritorious act.

15:19.300 --> 15:22.380
How would I dare monopolize something like that?

15:51.710 --> 15:53.160
Gui.

15:53.350 --> 15:54.800
Any news?

15:54.990 --> 15:56.446
The ship has moored at the fishing port in the east.

15:56.470 --> 15:57.726
Really?

15:57.750 --> 15:59.406
But there's at least ten li to go.

15:59.430 --> 16:01.086
Why isn't it at a dock nearby?

16:01.110 --> 16:02.326
It's a long story.

16:02.350 --> 16:03.586
But they have promised

16:03.610 --> 16:04.846
to send someone to help us.

16:04.870 --> 16:06.870
We need to get ready to set out as soon as possible.

16:06.990 --> 16:07.966
Master.

16:07.990 --> 16:10.606
Since the pirates' fleet entered the river a few days ago,

16:10.630 --> 16:13.006
the River Defense Office has stepped up its patrols.

16:13.030 --> 16:14.566
Master Guan didn't want to take the risk,

16:14.590 --> 16:17.350
so he moored the ship at the fishing port in the east.

16:17.700 --> 16:18.926
He didn’t want to take the risk?

16:18.950 --> 16:21.206
Wasn’t he the one who entered the river

16:21.230 --> 16:22.680
to transport raw silk into Nandu?

16:22.870 --> 16:24.736
He didn't deny this.

16:24.760 --> 16:26.366
But he asked me to tell you

16:26.390 --> 16:29.100
that he only transported the silk for money.

16:29.180 --> 16:30.766
Now, he is desperate for talented aides

16:30.790 --> 16:31.966
and needs someone like you,

16:31.990 --> 16:34.350
who knows the riverways well, urgently.

16:35.270 --> 16:37.780
Okay, you may leave.

16:38.090 --> 16:39.730
We'll be on standby.

16:46.310 --> 16:47.760
Master.

16:49.170 --> 16:53.490
I have an internal injury at a time like this.

16:54.110 --> 16:56.576
Is the Cao Sect fated to be destroyed?

16:56.600 --> 16:59.610
The men guarding outside are skilled.

16:59.790 --> 17:01.590
With Master Guan's help,

17:01.870 --> 17:03.790
we can definitely get out of here.

17:10.790 --> 17:12.725
I think there are only 15 people in the yard.

17:12.749 --> 17:13.816
We were careless just now

17:13.840 --> 17:14.886
and exposed ourselves.

17:14.910 --> 17:16.750
They are already on guard.

17:16.969 --> 17:18.849
What a good time for you to be careless.

17:19.509 --> 17:20.876
How can we launch a sneak attack?

17:20.900 --> 17:21.985
It doesn't matter.

17:22.009 --> 17:24.050
We have twice as many men as they do.

17:24.120 --> 17:26.016
Even if we attack by force, we'll still win.

17:26.040 --> 17:26.606
Yes.

17:26.630 --> 17:28.030
Even a wall can't stop us.

17:28.030 --> 17:29.166
Even so,

17:29.190 --> 17:30.790
when we guarded the relay station,

17:30.790 --> 17:31.810
we were also heavily outnumbered.

17:31.830 --> 17:32.916
There's only one wall,

17:32.940 --> 17:34.630
so it might not be appropriate to force our way in.

17:36.750 --> 17:38.016
Yun Xiang promised

17:38.040 --> 17:40.326
we will take Qi Tianfeng down without bloodshed.

17:40.350 --> 17:42.150
Let's just stand guard here first.

17:44.260 --> 17:45.646
It's boring to wait.

17:45.670 --> 17:47.546
Let's give him a hard time

17:47.570 --> 17:48.836
by announcing our presence.

17:48.860 --> 17:49.396
Good.

17:49.420 --> 17:51.030
- Okay.
- Let’s go.

17:57.470 --> 17:59.230
How many shadowmen have you brought?

18:08.870 --> 18:10.326
You're rich

18:10.350 --> 18:11.916
and you have strong men and sturdy horses at your disposal.

18:11.940 --> 18:13.036
I'm envious.

18:13.060 --> 18:14.486
Come on.

18:14.510 --> 18:15.846
Let me ask you.

18:15.870 --> 18:16.740
How did you know

18:16.740 --> 18:18.510
I can contact the pirates?

18:19.150 --> 18:21.736
You said it yourself after meeting Master last time.

18:21.760 --> 18:23.966
You once hired hundreds of pirate ships

18:23.990 --> 18:25.970
to rescue victims in Anqing Prefecture.

18:27.030 --> 18:29.150
That’s when you set your eyes on me?

18:29.630 --> 18:30.846
Of course.

18:30.870 --> 18:32.076
Okay.

18:32.100 --> 18:33.136
In the future, I'll be careful

18:33.160 --> 18:34.840
when I'm talking to you.

18:38.150 --> 18:39.990
What are you up to now?

18:44.350 --> 18:46.750
Qi Tianfeng's hideout

18:46.980 --> 18:49.350
is near a smuggling port.

18:49.700 --> 18:50.926
Yes.

18:50.950 --> 18:54.550
Smugglers collude with pirates too, right?

18:55.910 --> 18:57.830
No matter how badly injured he is,

18:57.870 --> 18:59.760
he can still escape by boat.

19:00.420 --> 19:01.626
But he chose to stay

19:01.650 --> 19:03.566
somewhere near Nandu City

19:03.590 --> 19:05.050
to wait for backup.

19:06.870 --> 19:08.510
Maybe we were careless.

19:08.750 --> 19:10.510
There might be unforeseen circumstances today.

19:11.030 --> 19:12.480
Full speed!

19:30.670 --> 19:32.310
Boss, someone is coming.

20:19.510 --> 20:20.960
Old dog!

20:22.110 --> 20:24.076
You don't even dare to show your face.

20:24.100 --> 20:26.210
You call yourself the Iron Hand Demon?

20:27.860 --> 20:29.646
Come out and fight us!

20:29.670 --> 20:31.950
That's right! Come out!

20:31.950 --> 20:35.446
Come out!

20:35.470 --> 20:37.300
Come out!

20:40.260 --> 20:43.840
Are you hungry after hiding for such a long time,

20:44.270 --> 20:46.780
so you roasted your own balls for food?

20:48.280 --> 20:50.446
No wonder you're all cowards.

20:50.470 --> 20:51.786
I'll kill them all!

20:51.810 --> 20:52.926
Ba.

20:52.950 --> 20:54.086
Don't go out.

20:54.110 --> 20:55.246
Don't fall into their trap.

20:55.270 --> 20:57.006
Even if I die,

20:57.030 --> 20:58.616
I can't let Master suffer this kind of humiliation.

20:58.640 --> 21:01.360
Master ordered us to stand guard in the courtyard.

21:04.790 --> 21:06.240
Brothers.

21:06.350 --> 21:07.726
Calm down.

21:07.750 --> 21:09.860
If they knew we had reinforcements,

21:09.960 --> 21:11.610
they would have attacked us.

21:12.860 --> 21:14.420
It's not too late to take revenge

21:14.790 --> 21:16.660
after Master Guan comes.

21:34.590 --> 21:36.310
They're Yun Xiang's reinforcements.

21:36.620 --> 21:37.806
That's a sea bugle.

21:37.830 --> 21:39.326
They should be pirates.

21:39.350 --> 21:40.800
Pirates?

21:41.620 --> 21:43.326
Will we come back from this alive

21:43.350 --> 21:45.410
to get paid?

21:53.110 --> 21:54.560
Brothers.

21:54.750 --> 21:56.296
I'm afraid we've run into pirates.

21:56.320 --> 21:58.320
If we try to escape, we'll die for sure.

21:58.870 --> 22:01.326
Kill them with me!

22:01.350 --> 22:07.390
Kill them! Kill them!

22:24.380 --> 22:26.860
Don't panic. I'll check it out first.

22:27.940 --> 22:30.670
How dare you draw your swords when I, Guan, am here?

22:31.920 --> 22:33.906
[Pirate, Master Guan]

22:33.480 --> 22:34.406
Everyone,

22:34.430 --> 22:36.360
we're here to settle a score.

22:36.390 --> 22:37.900
We won't get in your way.

22:38.550 --> 22:40.320
I am a man of the sea.

22:40.870 --> 22:43.020
I don't understand your nonsense.

22:51.910 --> 22:53.750
When the people of the sea come ashore,

22:54.260 --> 22:56.260
you must follow the rules of the land.

23:04.070 --> 23:06.790
Master, it's Master Guan.

23:07.970 --> 23:10.956
Since he's here, we should meet.

23:10.980 --> 23:12.430
Open the door.

23:34.750 --> 23:38.150
Master Guan, how have you been?

23:38.590 --> 23:40.006
I'm good, of course.

23:40.030 --> 23:43.350
How did you end up like this?

23:44.540 --> 23:46.230
I made a miscalculation.

23:46.790 --> 23:49.540
I'm afraid I'll have to rely on you in the future.

23:49.750 --> 23:51.200
No problem.

23:52.700 --> 23:54.506
Let's fight into the courtyard

23:54.530 --> 23:55.056
before making any further plans.

23:55.080 --> 23:56.530
Master Guan.

24:30.030 --> 24:32.130
Which of the Masters of the Three Oceans and Seven Islands

24:32.340 --> 24:35.780
do you know, Lass?

24:36.350 --> 24:38.030
Master Liu of Baisha Island.

24:38.200 --> 24:39.766
Five years ago, I traveled across the East Sea

24:39.790 --> 24:41.430
and saved his ship.

24:41.590 --> 24:43.390
Since it's a blood debt,

24:43.570 --> 24:46.460
you may live today.

24:47.530 --> 24:48.980
According to the rules,

24:49.650 --> 24:51.480
I have the final say

24:51.590 --> 24:53.150
on how this blood debt is to be repaid.

24:55.270 --> 24:57.300
You have a temper.

24:58.160 --> 24:59.610
Tell me then.

25:00.380 --> 25:01.326
Master.

25:01.350 --> 25:03.930
Should we start fighting? If this goes on—

25:08.670 --> 25:10.406
Leave Qi Tianfeng to me

25:10.430 --> 25:11.880
and let us go.

25:14.630 --> 25:16.086
Are you kidding me?

25:16.110 --> 25:17.736
This is the rule of the sea.

25:17.760 --> 25:20.310
If you refuse to repay a blood debt, you will suffer a shipwreck.

25:20.630 --> 25:22.490
That’s right.

25:23.260 --> 25:26.230
But I have already killed Master Liu.

25:27.500 --> 25:29.670
It's no one's debt now.

25:34.750 --> 25:36.800
Do I need to pay you back?

25:38.390 --> 25:40.310
If you don't follow the rules of the sea,

25:40.910 --> 25:43.270
then follow the rules of the martial arts world.

25:44.510 --> 25:45.960
Stop!

25:50.350 --> 25:51.800
Ms. Shu.

25:52.110 --> 25:54.150
Don't be rude to Master Guan.

25:55.100 --> 25:56.546
Mo!

25:56.570 --> 25:58.020
Guan.

25:58.390 --> 26:00.060
Why are you here?

26:01.510 --> 26:04.550
- That Lass…
- Master, it's not looking good.

26:05.500 --> 26:06.980
Let's retreat.

26:07.980 --> 26:10.880
How have you been?

26:45.400 --> 26:46.850
Master Qi.

26:47.150 --> 26:48.710
We meet again.

26:53.750 --> 26:55.126
Brothers!

26:55.150 --> 26:56.600
Withdraw!

26:58.110 --> 26:59.560
Master Guan!

27:00.110 --> 27:02.590
You're not a man who goes back on your word.

27:02.740 --> 27:03.846
Ridiculous!

27:03.870 --> 27:05.750
When have I ever had a good reputation?

27:12.590 --> 27:14.040
Qi Tianfeng.

27:14.580 --> 27:16.206
Let's settle our score

27:16.230 --> 27:17.636
once and for all.

27:17.660 --> 27:20.110
If you break your meridians and destroy your internal force,

27:20.820 --> 27:23.170
I guarantee your brothers won't be hurt.

27:24.030 --> 27:26.046
The worst is death.

27:26.070 --> 27:28.390
How can we let Master suffer humiliation?

27:34.270 --> 27:36.110
You are willing to die for him,

27:37.290 --> 27:41.360
but your Master is a righteous man.

27:42.050 --> 27:43.540
He might not be willing to let you do that.

27:43.820 --> 27:44.886
Yun Xiang.

27:44.910 --> 27:46.800
Don't go too far.

28:02.310 --> 28:03.760
Master Qi,

28:03.960 --> 28:07.246
you came to Guanghui Bank to give me pointers.

28:07.270 --> 28:09.076
You must have expended a great deal of energy.

28:09.100 --> 28:12.246
What? Do you want to have another duel today?

28:12.270 --> 28:13.720
Mo Bufan.

28:14.380 --> 28:16.060
You're a lackey to an evildoer.

28:16.350 --> 28:18.000
You'll have it coming to you!

28:32.110 --> 28:33.560
Yun Xiang.

28:35.430 --> 28:38.750
Are you willing to protect my brothers in the Cao Sect?

28:39.390 --> 28:43.340
You still care for your brothers at this juncture?

28:51.160 --> 28:53.670
Okay, I promise you.

28:59.520 --> 29:01.000
I believe you.

29:13.520 --> 29:15.950
- Don’t, Master.
- Go away!

29:50.260 --> 29:51.496
- Master!
- Master!

29:51.520 --> 29:52.970
Master!

30:25.110 --> 30:26.516
Guan.

30:26.540 --> 30:28.030
Not bad.

30:28.510 --> 30:31.046
You have all of the Three Oceans and Seven Islands under your command.

30:31.070 --> 30:32.910
Even Wang Wufeng hadn't managed to do that

30:32.910 --> 30:34.406
at his peak.

30:34.430 --> 30:35.116
You're amazing.

30:35.140 --> 30:37.220
Things have changed.

30:37.440 --> 30:39.256
There aren't many in this business now.

30:39.280 --> 30:40.360
Anyone who has a few lousy ships

30:40.380 --> 30:43.790
and is brazen enough calls himself a Master.

30:43.990 --> 30:46.020
What's the point of subduing them?

30:46.590 --> 30:47.846
Master.

30:47.870 --> 30:49.320
Master.

30:52.110 --> 30:53.560
Here.

30:59.210 --> 31:01.146
How are our men?

31:01.170 --> 31:03.180
Don't worry. They're fine.

31:08.030 --> 31:10.580
What did Mo Bufan give you

31:12.190 --> 31:15.160
to make you turn against me at this juncture?

31:16.210 --> 31:18.350
To be honest,

31:18.750 --> 31:20.450
even if they hadn't shown up,

31:20.670 --> 31:22.510
you wouldn't have gotten to live.

31:23.590 --> 31:25.390
Why are you looking at me?

31:25.550 --> 31:28.910
You have yourself to blame for messing with too many people.

31:29.120 --> 31:32.590
Someone offered me a huge sum to silence you.

31:33.630 --> 31:35.950
I wanted to lure you onto my ship first.

31:37.110 --> 31:38.820
Who offered you money?

31:39.130 --> 31:41.470
Who wants to silence you? Don't you know?

31:41.820 --> 31:43.780
Do I have to say it here?

31:49.930 --> 31:51.810
Tang Xiao, right?

31:55.900 --> 31:57.350
Let's go.

31:58.050 --> 32:00.310
We have nothing to do with this place anymore.

32:01.840 --> 32:03.290
Let's go.

32:11.820 --> 32:13.270
Lean on me.

32:23.810 --> 32:25.526
Who is that young man?

32:25.550 --> 32:27.116
Yun Xiang, what's wrong?

32:27.140 --> 32:28.936
This guy is interesting.

32:28.960 --> 32:30.156
I have been to Nandu twice.

32:30.180 --> 32:32.380
I hear people talking about him everywhere.

32:32.680 --> 32:35.920
I am in need of a smart subordinate.

32:36.750 --> 32:39.460
Why don't you talk to him for me?

32:39.610 --> 32:40.886
Guan, forget it.

32:40.910 --> 32:42.316
He's not easy to deal with.

32:42.340 --> 32:43.656
Don't have designs on him.

32:43.680 --> 32:44.916
Fine.

32:44.940 --> 32:46.616
You made me come here for nothing.

32:46.640 --> 32:47.486
How will you compensate me?

32:47.510 --> 32:50.156
I'll prepare a big gift for you.

32:50.180 --> 32:51.606
Okay.

32:51.630 --> 32:53.016
I'll be off now.

32:53.040 --> 32:54.490
Let me see you off.

32:55.980 --> 32:57.430
Have some water.

32:58.950 --> 33:02.650
So you've been following Tang Xiao's orders?

33:04.950 --> 33:06.166
Ding Yi.

33:06.190 --> 33:07.750
- Master.
- Leave us.

33:08.300 --> 33:08.946
Master.

33:08.970 --> 33:10.420
Go.

33:18.380 --> 33:19.830
Yun Xiang.

33:20.030 --> 33:22.750
You want to investigate the massacre in Luo Family's village?

33:23.910 --> 33:25.216
Let me ask you first.

33:25.240 --> 33:27.400
How deep will you look?

33:28.870 --> 33:32.450
Anyone who was involved must pay the price.

33:36.320 --> 33:37.770
Good.

33:41.450 --> 33:42.910
Very good.

33:47.620 --> 33:49.666
I've been

33:49.690 --> 33:52.140
in a risky trade all my life.

33:52.180 --> 33:54.390
At times, I have done unrighteous acts.

33:55.150 --> 33:57.190
But to be honest,

33:57.950 --> 34:00.390
it wasn't just to make money.

34:00.610 --> 34:02.856
I also want to see those arrogant

34:02.880 --> 34:05.266
and prestigious families

34:05.290 --> 34:06.346
fall from grace

34:06.370 --> 34:08.605
and experience how the rest of the world lives.

34:08.629 --> 34:11.209
So you wanted to use me to deal with the Su family

34:11.330 --> 34:13.255
to fulfill your wish?

34:13.279 --> 34:14.729
Yes.

34:14.770 --> 34:16.700
You can keep investigating

34:17.390 --> 34:18.910
the Luo Family's village case.

34:19.870 --> 34:22.030
But Nandu CIty

34:22.790 --> 34:25.720
will be ruined by you first.

34:37.000 --> 34:38.450
Qi Tianfeng.

34:38.670 --> 34:40.880
You've said many useless things.

34:41.410 --> 34:43.800
Why don't you explain what happened to my family first?

34:44.140 --> 34:45.590
Okay.

34:46.350 --> 34:49.366
I've already talked about your family's armed escort agency.

34:49.390 --> 34:50.950
At this point,

34:51.510 --> 34:53.350
you're still pinning it on Wen Cong?

34:56.470 --> 34:58.960
You used to call him Godfather,

34:59.900 --> 35:02.110
but now you call him by his name.

35:02.950 --> 35:04.470
That means what I said just now...

35:04.470 --> 35:07.140
Y- You believed me.

35:07.710 --> 35:08.866
Ms. Shu.

35:08.890 --> 35:11.210
Wen Cong destroyed the armed escort agency back then.

35:12.190 --> 35:13.950
But now,

35:14.350 --> 35:16.350
Yun Xiang has provoked

35:16.350 --> 35:18.996
the bet between the Su family and me.

35:19.020 --> 35:21.740
Aren't the tactics similar?

35:23.100 --> 35:25.090
Think about it.

35:26.430 --> 35:27.880
Of course,

35:29.430 --> 35:31.750
I did all these.

35:32.540 --> 35:35.100
If you kill me now,

35:35.980 --> 35:37.820
that's right too.

35:47.950 --> 35:49.710
Keep talking about Luo Family's village.

35:49.750 --> 35:52.830
What was the relationship between the massacre and Tang Xiao?

35:52.980 --> 35:55.430
It was a complicated relationship.

35:55.990 --> 35:57.206
What about Wen Cong's imprisonment?

35:57.230 --> 35:58.646
He moved it along.

35:58.670 --> 36:02.510
Tang Xiao is a tyrant in Nandu City,

36:02.560 --> 36:04.306
but he's just a puppet.

36:04.330 --> 36:06.220
Who is behind him?

36:06.490 --> 36:09.560
I've been investigating this for years.

36:10.490 --> 36:13.820
But I'm not sure what is true.

36:14.870 --> 36:16.320
Go on.

36:16.430 --> 36:19.660
Tang Xiao laundered his dirty money using the gambling house

36:20.350 --> 36:23.070
and then transported the money north of the Yangtze River.

36:23.770 --> 36:25.156
Since he wants to cross the river,

36:25.180 --> 36:27.630
he must use the Cao Sect's ships.

36:29.990 --> 36:32.030
One of my trusted subordinates

36:32.690 --> 36:34.850
accidentally heard their secret.

36:36.490 --> 36:37.940
The Lingyuan Sect.

36:48.050 --> 36:52.020
Do you have any evidence?

37:02.470 --> 37:05.846
Where is the henchman you mentioned?

37:05.870 --> 37:08.190
He was ordered to rob the traveling merchants

37:08.590 --> 37:10.150
and never returned.

37:12.990 --> 37:14.750
Since you have no evidence,

37:15.070 --> 37:16.930
keep talking about Luo Family's village.

37:18.510 --> 37:20.596
What did Wen Cong tell you?

37:20.620 --> 37:22.510
He said he just wanted to buy the land.

37:22.980 --> 37:24.890
What happened after that

37:25.150 --> 37:26.870
was totally beyond his expectations.

37:27.190 --> 37:29.236
He wasn't lying.

37:29.260 --> 37:30.646
What happened after that?

37:30.670 --> 37:31.826
What did you do after that?

37:31.850 --> 37:33.430
What did Tang Xiao do?

37:33.730 --> 37:35.940
It was a common way of acquiring land.

37:37.190 --> 37:40.710
They bribed the soldiers and threatened the villagers.

37:40.780 --> 37:43.196
But I don't usually deal with the government

37:43.220 --> 37:44.766
and nor do I have such connections.

37:44.790 --> 37:47.086
So Tang Xiao came to me and said

37:47.110 --> 37:50.126
he had a deep relationship with the Government Office

37:50.150 --> 37:51.966
and offered to mediate.

37:51.990 --> 37:53.440
In other words,

37:55.470 --> 37:58.676
you didn't know a single thing

37:58.700 --> 38:00.680
about the massacre of the village?

38:03.190 --> 38:05.340
I heard about it.

38:06.420 --> 38:08.570
I heard about it before the incident.

38:09.270 --> 38:11.370
But I didn't pay attention to it,

38:11.620 --> 38:13.676
and I didn't tell Wen Cong.

38:13.700 --> 38:15.860
Those were 313 lives.

38:16.670 --> 38:18.510
How could you ignore them?

38:34.010 --> 38:35.460
Yun Xiang.

38:35.950 --> 38:37.550
I was an itinerant

38:37.550 --> 38:39.326
who couldn't even guarantee my own survival.

38:39.350 --> 38:42.310
How could I offend Tang Xiao

38:42.310 --> 38:43.286
for the sake of people I hadn't even met,

38:43.310 --> 38:45.550
much less offend

38:45.550 --> 38:47.850
those soldiers who killed so many people?

38:51.790 --> 38:53.830
That's all I have to say.

38:53.950 --> 38:56.510
I've told you everything I know.

39:02.280 --> 39:04.540
If you follow this lead,

39:05.830 --> 39:08.350
you will find out the truth

39:08.430 --> 39:09.880
about the massacre of Luo Family’s village.

39:10.430 --> 39:13.230
If you manage to catch Tang Xiao,

39:13.870 --> 39:16.230
you can gorge out my eyes

39:16.230 --> 39:17.070
so that I can see

39:17.070 --> 39:19.550
him being destroyed.

39:30.650 --> 39:32.870
I've said everything I need to say.

39:35.770 --> 39:37.950
Please keep your promise

39:39.930 --> 39:42.480
and don't hurt my men.

39:44.730 --> 39:46.470
Let them go.

40:07.740 --> 40:10.310
It's time to end this.

40:11.620 --> 40:13.070
Ms. Shu.

40:16.020 --> 40:17.510
Go ahead.
